Job ResponsibilitiesAssist in collecting and organizing data to ensure timely and accurate data updates；Participate in producing weekly operations analysis reports；Track campaign performance and organize and analyze campaign data；Participate in frontline marketing activities, conducting market research and data collection; 
Job RequirementsBachelor's degree or above；Majors in economics, statistics, or related fields preferred；Excel proficiency is a must: not only pivot tables, but also advanced functions such as IFS and VLOOKUP for data cleaning and preliminary modeling；SQL/Python/R: Able to use SQL for data extraction and group-by analysis; able to use Python or R for data processing, cleaning, and visualization；Data visualization: Able to clearly and intuitively present business conclusions with charts (whether Excel charts or those generated by programming tools), rather than piling up numbers；Experience with BI tools / data visualization tools preferred；Internship experience in FMCG, retail, or channel-related fields preferred；
Nice-to-have:AI tool usage: Familiar with and have used AI tools such as GPT to assist data analysis and improve efficiency;Legal right to work in the UK; UK driving license ((Not mandatory);

